{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Recover persisted child links before returning.** This map is memory-only, although the parent and child linkage is persisted. After a runner restart\u2014or a crash after the child's terminal state is saved\u2014this lookup returns `None`, leaving the parent's invoke `STARTED` indefinitely. Rebuild/reconcile links from the store on startup, or recover them from `child.parent_execution_arn` and `parent.chained_invoke_children` on a miss. Add a filesystem/SQLite restart test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7wVjpz","finding_digest":"37e024583fa24dc83171a92690d19d6ec04a473f6ff95d054e9e080bd309dfa8","finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","line":1802,"observation_digest":"cdb155db0bc927a13ead5f041660016501d5deccb14280589374023907cb2ba3","observation_id":"aro_v1_zwyvlwylzet2cpvnl4cbmyabmu","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T01:13:21Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jcubvkvc46wxo6g6noxo6h2xup","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"3d178588333d0735a6fc4b6223119a885347eb6e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1798,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_elth6ypnkpmerkbcjinigixvfh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T01:13:21Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
